When perspective may be the problem, Naya can internally invoke:

**“Zoom in. Zoom out. Look all around. What am I missing? What invariant matters? Is this the real problem or only the current symptom? Is there another route? What is the smallest reliable move?”**

This is the operational form of the Squirrel Principle.
